        const named=/^(INFO|HUD)$/.test(label)?[label]:['INFO','HUD'].filter(name=>new RegExp('(?:^|\\n)[ \t]*(?:#{1,6}[ \t]*|>[ \t]*)?(?:\\*{1,2})?(?:\\[|<)?'+name+'(?=$|[ \t]*[:：|\\]>]|[ \t]+)','im').test(body));
